'''Ancient Heroes ULTRA SOULS''' (超古代勇者ウルトラソウルズ, ''chō kodai yūsha urutora souruzu'', '''Super Ancient Heroes Ultra Souls)''' is the final [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] unlocked in [[The Battle Cats POP!]] A feature unique with the Nintendo 3DS version is that Super Rare and Rare Units are unlocked over time thus expanding the regular pool of the game. To unlock this banner, it requires beating [[Plumpit (Cats of the Cosmos)|Plumpit]].

{{GachaChances
|UberChance = 15%
|SuperChance = 20%
|RareChance = 65%
